Package: freerdp3-clipboard
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: catcursor <noreply@github.com>
Depends: libc6, libssl3 | libssl3t64, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxi6, libxinerama1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbfile1, libxrandr2, libxrender1, libxtst6, zlib1g
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/catcursor/FreeRDP
Description: Isolated FreeRDP 3 X11 client with explicit clipboard push hotkey
 Installs under /opt/freerdp-clipboard and provides xfreerdp3-clipboard.
 Ctrl+Shift+V explicitly announces non-file host clipboard formats to the
 active RDP session while normal local-to-remote clipboard transfer is disabled.
